  "title": "etw: Add missing type specifier for PcapNgIfIndex",
  "description": "The static variable PcapNgIfIndex in AddInterface() is declared without a type specifier:\n\n```\nstatic PcapNgIfIndex = 1;\n```\n\nThis relies on implicit int, which was removed in C99 (6.7.2p2) and is a hard error in C23. GCC and Clang both diagnose it with -Wimplicit-int. Declare it as int explicitly.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Claude Code, Claude Opus 4.8)",
  "state": "merged",
